  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_01",
      "hash64": "B867252596185671",
      "text": "Miei carissimi studenti, come state?\\nSiete tutti in forma?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_02",
      "hash64": "B867222596185158",
      "text": "My name is Salvis!\\nDi nuovo: my name is Salvis![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_03",
      "hash64": "B86723259618530B",
      "text": "Sono felice di vedervi tutti così attenti!\\nThank you! Grazie![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_04",
      "hash64": "B867282596185B8A",
      "text": "Sono very happy di poter accompagnare\\ndei giovani come voi in uno dei periodi\\r\\npiù emozionanti della vita![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_05",
      "hash64": "B867292596185D3D",
      "text": "Il mio nome è una promessa che faccio a tutti voi.\\c\\nNavigheremo assieme il mare impetuoso delle\\nlingue straniere, ma sempre \"salvis rebus\"...\\r\\ncioè in piena sicurezza![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_06",
      "hash64": "B867262596185824",
      "text": "Proprio così, sono il vostro insegnante di lingue!\\c\\nDurante le mie lezioni imparerete un sacco di\\ncose interessanti sul mondo delle parole![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_07",
      "hash64": "B8672725961859D7",
      "text": "Lo sapevate che saluti come \"buongiorno\"\\no \"ciao\" cambiano a seconda del luogo\\r\\nin cui ci si trova?\\c\\nPer esempio, in alcune parti del mondo\\npotrebbero dire \"good morning\" o \"hello\"![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 185,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_08",
      "hash64": "B8671C2596184726",
      "text": "Ma non solo! Ci sono anche persone che si\\ninventano saluti unendo parole diverse!\\c\\nPer esempio, conosco una streamer che saluta\\nchi la segue dicendo sempre \"buenosday\"![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_09",
      "hash64": "B8671D25961848D9",
      "text": "Nel mondo ci sono un sacco di paesi in cui si\\nparlano una miriade di lingue differenti![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_10",
      "hash64": "B86AAA25961B6E47",
      "text": "Xièxie! Obrigado! Danke! Merci! Gracias!\\nQueste parole significano tutte la stessa cosa!\\r\\nChi mi sa dire cosa?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 8,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_d_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "6023657BE692D927",
      "text": "Arrivederci!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_d_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "6023667BE692DADA",
      "text": "Grazie!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_d_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "6023677BE692DC8D",
      "text": "Buonanotte!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_answer_01",
      "hash64": "45494461C655FB1A",
      "text": "Tu sei [VAR 0x0100(0000)], giusto?\\c\\nLa risposta è sbagliata, ma l’atteggiamento è\\nal cento per cento quello giusto!\\r\\nCon le lingue bisogna buttarsi![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_answer_02",
      "hash64": "45494361C655F967",
      "text": "Tu sei [VAR 0x0100(0000)], giusto?\\nBravissim[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! Risposta very very esatta!\\c\\nE anche l’atteggiamento è quello giusto!\\nCon le lingue bisogna buttarsi![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_answer_03",
      "hash64": "45494261C655F7B4",
      "text": "Tu sei [VAR 0x0100(0000)], giusto?\\c\\nLa risposta è sbagliata, ma l’atteggiamento è\\nal cento per cento quello giusto!\\r\\nCon le lingue bisogna buttarsi![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
